      "content": "The weight of that failure is crushing, and the silence of the ash is deafening. You carry the weight of a kingdom's end, but your existence is not the final monument to what was lost. Look at the survivors; they are anchors to a future that can only be built from this ruin. Find a way to let the ghost find its rest, even if that rest is in the fight to survive this moment.",
